    "testimonial_slider": {
      "type": "testimonial-slider",
      "blocks": {
        "r1": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5.0",
            "quote": "\"I stopped losing words mid-sentence\"",
            "details": "I'm a project manager. I'm on calls all day. And for the last year I've been forgetting words. Simple words. I'd be presenting and just... blank. Dead air. My face going red.\nI Googled 'early onset dementia at 38.' That's how scared I was.\nPut this bracelet on. By week 2 the words started coming back. By week 4 I ran a meeting without a single blank. I almost cried at my desk.\nIt's not dementia. It's blood flow. And this fixed it.",
            "author_name": "SARAH M.",
            "tag_1": "Word Finding",
            "tag_2": "Clarity Back",
            "card_bg_color": ""
          }
        },
        "r2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5.0",
            "quote": "\"My brain felt wrapped in cotton wool. Now it doesn't.\"",
            "details": "That's the only way I could describe it. Like everything was muffled. I couldn't hold a thought. I'd walk into rooms and forget why.\nMy doctor said it was stress. My friends said it was 'mom brain.' I knew it was something else.\n3 weeks wearing Azurite and the cotton wool lifted. I can think again. I can follow conversations. I can make a decision without agonizing for an hour.\nThis is what my brain is supposed to feel like.",
            "author_name": "MEGAN K.",
            "tag_1": "Brain Fog",
            "tag_2": "Mom of 2",
            "card_bg_color": ""
          }
        },
        "r3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5.0",
            "quote": "\"Focus without Adderall. Finally.\"",
            "details": "I was seriously considering asking my doctor for Adderall. Not because I have ADHD — because I couldn't concentrate on ANYTHING for more than 5 minutes.\nA friend suggested this bracelet. I was skeptical.\nWeek 1: nothing dramatic. Week 2: I finished a report without checking my phone once. Week 3: my boss said 'whatever you're doing, keep doing it.'\nNo stimulants. No side effects. Just my brain working again.",
            "author_name": "RACHEL T.",
            "tag_1": "Focus",
            "tag_2": "No Stimulants",
            "card_bg_color": ""
          }
        },
        "r4": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5.0",
            "quote": "\"I forgot why I walked into the kitchen. Every day. Not anymore.\"",
            "details": "It became a running joke in my house. 'Why did you come in here?' 'No idea.'\nExcept it wasn't funny. It was terrifying. I'm 41. I shouldn't be this foggy.\nAzurite gave me my mind back. Not overnight. But gradually — like someone wiped a dirty window clean, one section at a time.\nI can hold a thought now. I can remember things. I feel SHARP again.",
            "author_name": "JEN L.",
            "tag_1": "Memory",
            "tag_2": "Foggy to Sharp",
            "card_bg_color": ""
          }
        },
        "r5": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "4.8",
            "quote": "\"My IQ didn't halve. My blood flow did.\"",
            "details": "That's what it felt like though. Like I went from sharp to stupid overnight.\nPerimenopause + stress + two kids + full-time work = my brain checked out.\nI wore Azurite for a month. The fog cleared. The decision fatigue eased. I stopped staring at my screen for 20 minutes doing nothing.\nI'm not losing my mind. My brain was just underfueled. Now it's not.",
            "author_name": "TONYA W.",
            "tag_1": "Perimenopause",
            "tag_2": "IQ Restored",
            "card_bg_color": ""
          }
        }
      },
